From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP spawn search skips a cut section

blocksAddChunk is false while a player stands in the column. Login
findSpawnAround walks west from spawn into that section, one bot there
re-opens syncLoadNonFull, and the region thread waits for a chunk the
carve will not finish. Return null for a registered cut section.
playerInChunk stays on tickets and the chunk loader. Post-applyAllPatches.
---

--- a/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/net/minecraft/server/level/PlayerSpawnFinder.java
+++ b/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/net/minecraft/server/level/PlayerSpawnFinder.java
@@ -152,10 +152,10 @@
     public static @Nullable BlockPos getLevelRespawnPos(final ServerLevel level, final int x, final int z) { // Folia - public
         final int chunkX = SectionPos.blockToSectionCoord(x);
         final int chunkZ = SectionPos.blockToSectionCoord(z);
-        // Packed-spawn cut: syncLoadNonFull into the empty buffer parks the region thread
-        // forever (ticket wall never completes). Death during carve then watchdog-stalls
-        // before forcePartition can log into-shards.
-        if (io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.YapRegionizerGap.blocksAddChunk(level, chunkX, chunkZ)) {
+        // Registered cut section. blocksAddChunk is false while a player stands in
+        // the column, and syncLoadNonFull then waits for a chunk the carve will not
+        // finish. findSpawnAround tries the next column. Tickets still pin that player.
+        if (io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.YapRegionizerGap.isCutChunk(level, chunkX, chunkZ)) {
             return null;
         }
         boolean caveWorld = level.dimensionType().hasCeiling();
--- a/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/scheduling/ChunkTaskScheduler.java
+++ b/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/scheduling/ChunkTaskScheduler.java
@@ -530,8 +530,9 @@
             return loaded;
         }
 
-        // Cut keys never reach FULL. managedBlock here is the packed-spawn watchdog.
-        if (io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.YapRegionizerGap.blocksAddChunk(this.world, chunkX, chunkZ)) {
+        // Registered cut section. Do not consult playerInChunk: a bot standing in
+        // the strip must not reopen managedBlock on a chunk the carve will not finish.
+        if (io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.YapRegionizerGap.isCutChunk(this.world, chunkX, chunkZ)) {
             return null;
         }
 
